   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Asking how long",
     "texto": [
      "**De când vă simțiți rău?** asks «How long have you been feeling unwell?». To say how long a symptom has lasted, we use the present and **de** plus a duration: **Mă doare spatele de trei zile** («My back has hurt for three days»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "At the surgery",
     "texto": [
      "**Cabinet** is the surgery or consulting room. **Pacient** means «patient»; **pacienta** is the feminine form."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
